INPUT:
  Batch of padded sequences with pad_mask
  Current score y_curr at each step (from inputs)
OUTPUT:
  y_hat (next score), delta, change_logit

BACKBONE(X, pad_mask):
  1. Embed categorical codes (CCAM/type/event_type) and static covariates (sex/UF/thesaurus)
  2. Concatenate:
       [text_emb, code_embs, Δt, modality_masks, score_features, projected_static]
  3. TimeAwareGRU with hidden decay driven by Δt
  4. Project and apply causal Transformer (no leakage to future):
       h = Transformer(h, causal_mask, key_padding_mask = ~pad_mask)
  5. return h

TWO-HEAD PREDICTOR(h, y_curr):
  delta       = Linear(h)              # regression head
  change_logit= Linear(h)              # classification head
  y_hat       = y_curr + delta
  return y_hat, delta, change_logit
